{"path":".agents/skills/comprehende/references/example.md","ref":"b07fc28178e9c6bb9066fc5f1a5d3511f22b8670","side":"new","lines":[{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":1,"text":"# Example review.json"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":2,"text":""},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":3,"text":"Optional filled sample. The field shape in `SKILL.md` is enough to write a document. Paths come from the `pregroup` draft, and so does `source`. When a file is split, `oldStart` and `newStart` come from that hunk's `@@` header."},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":4,"text":""},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":5,"text":"- `login` depends on `cookie`. Both use `part` \"Session cookie\". The helper's test sits in `cookie` with the helper it checks."},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":6,"text":"- `docs` is a separate part, last in `suggestedOrder`, because it could have been its own pull request."},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":7,"text":"- Ticket #12 names why this work exists, so document `why` is present. Document `title` keeps the ticket title. Document `summary` names both stories. Document `parts` holds a one-sentence what per story. The why cites the ticket with `[#12](source:s1)`."},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":8,"text":"- `login` `summary` names how those hunks meet. `login` `lookFor` is a predicted trace. `docs` has no `lookFor`."},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":9,"text":"- Document `lookFor` compares ticket #12 with the diff: work the ticket asks for that no hunk does, and one claim about the whole change. Both cite `[#12](source:s1)`. Group `lookFor` stays inside its hunks."},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":10,"text":"- Each group holds every hunk of its files, so each `hunkRefs` entry is a path. A split file uses `path@oldStart+newStart` (`old/path -> new/path@oldStart+newStart` when renamed). A directory of mechanical files the draft collapsed stays one `dir/` ref."},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":11,"text":""},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":12,"text":"```json"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":13,"text":"{"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":14,"text":"  \"version\": 1,"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":15,"text":"  \"source\": {"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":16,"text":"    \"baseRef\": \"origin/main\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":17,"text":"    \"headRef\": \"HEAD\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":18,"text":"    \"range\": \"origin/main...HEAD\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":19,"text":"    \"baseSha\": \"3f1c0a9d2b8e4c6f7a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":20,"text":"    \"headSha\": \"9b8a7c6d5e4f30211fedcba9876543210fedcba9\""},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":21,"text":"  },"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":22,"text":"  \"size\": \"small\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":23,"text":"  \"title\": \"HttpOnly session cookies\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":24,"text":"  \"why\": \"[#12](source:s1) requires login sessions that client scripts cannot read.\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":25,"text":"  \"summary\": \"`setSessionCookie` applies HttpOnly cookie options, and the login route uses it. The README documents this behavior.\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":26,"text":"  \"parts\": ["},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":27,"text":"    {"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":28,"text":"      \"name\": \"Session cookie\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":29,"text":"      \"summary\": \"`setSessionCookie` applies HttpOnly cookie options, and the login route uses it.\""},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":30,"text":"    },"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":31,"text":"    {"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":32,"text":"      \"name\": \"README\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":33,"text":"      \"summary\": \"The README documents the new session cookie behavior.\""},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":34,"text":"    }"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":35,"text":"  ],"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":36,"text":"  \"sources\": ["},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":37,"text":"    {"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":38,"text":"      \"id\": \"s1\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":39,"text":"      \"kind\": \"ticket\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":40,"text":"      \"label\": \"#12\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":41,"text":"      \"title\": \"HttpOnly session cookies\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":42,"text":"      \"gist\": \"Requires login sessions that client scripts cannot read.\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":43,"text":"      \"part\": \"Session cookie\""},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":44,"text":"    }"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":45,"text":"  ],"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":46,"text":"  \"lookFor\": ["},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":47,"text":"    \"[#12](source:s1) also asks logout to clear the session cookie. No hunk touches `src/api/logout.ts`.\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":48,"text":"    \"Subtle. [#12](source:s1) wants sessions that client scripts cannot read. Sessions issued before this change keep their old cookie until it expires; no hunk rotates them.\""},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":49,"text":"  ],"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":50,"text":"  \"groups\": ["},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":51,"text":"    {"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":52,"text":"      \"id\": \"cookie\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":53,"text":"      \"title\": \"Session cookie helper\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":54,"text":"      \"why\": \"The login route needs one helper to apply the session cookie options.\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":55,"text":"      \"summary\": \"`setSessionCookie` applies the required options to session cookies, and its test checks them.\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":56,"text":"      \"part\": \"Session cookie\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":57,"text":"      \"lookFor\": [\"Breaking. `setSessionCookie` throws when the caller passes `httpOnly: false`.\"],"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":58,"text":"      \"suggestedOrder\": 0,"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":59,"text":"      \"hunkRefs\": [\"src/auth/session.ts\", \"src/auth/session.test.ts\"]"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":60,"text":"    },"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":61,"text":"    {"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":62,"text":"      \"id\": \"login\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":63,"text":"      \"title\": \"Login route\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":64,"text":"      \"why\": \"[#12](source:s1) requires HttpOnly session cookies. The route must set them through the helper.\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":65,"text":"      \"summary\": \"The login route in `login.ts` uses `setSessionCookie` from `session.ts`.\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":66,"text":"      \"part\": \"Session cookie\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":67,"text":"      \"sources\": [\"s1\"],"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":68,"text":"      \"lookFor\": ["},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":69,"text":"        \"For `rememberMe = false`, compare the cookie: old code permits script access; new code sets `HttpOnly` and omits `Max-Age`.\""},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":70,"text":"      ],"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":71,"text":"      \"dependsOn\": [\"cookie\"],"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":72,"text":"      \"suggestedOrder\": 1,"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":73,"text":"      \"hunkRefs\": [\"src/api/login.ts\"]"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":74,"text":"    },"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":75,"text":"    {"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":76,"text":"      \"id\": \"docs\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":77,"text":"      \"title\": \"README wording\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":78,"text":"      \"why\": \"The README still describes the previous cookie behavior.\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":79,"text":"      \"summary\": \"The README section on sessions matches the new cookie behavior.\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":80,"text":"      \"part\": \"README\","},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":81,"text":"      \"suggestedOrder\": 2,"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":82,"text":"      \"hunkRefs\": [\"README.md\"]"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":83,"text":"    }"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":84,"text":"  ]"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":85,"text":"}"},{"sha":"cf4f9973cd202f6a3f3d3cfba31d98b5178fa0a9","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868569,"line":86,"text":"```"}]}
